<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex details 1996 expenditures.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex details 1996 expenditures.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported Tuesday its capital and exploratory expenditures for 1996. Figures in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>Item		    1995 Expenses   1996 Expenses</p>
<p>Total			  2,468	     3,473</p>
<p>Exploration &amp; Production 1,504	     2,393</p>
<p>Refining &amp; Marketing	 756		 739</p>
<p>Natural Gas, NGLs	    115		 182</p>
<p>Chemicals			 62		  52</p>
<p>Other			     31		 107</p>
<p>1996 Budget includes off balance sheet projects.</p>
<p>--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7903.</p>
</text>
